  Content: An enclosed network of magical computing devices used solely within the
    city of Agartha. The Coil leverages a pre-existing network of wiring strung throughout
    Agartha from ancient times. Data transfer is facilitated through the encoding
    of messages via the Universal Spell Protocol (USP) invented by Typocrypha developer
    Ostanes.
